<https://w3id.org/spectra/per-wg/ran1> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "SPECTRA per-WG schema instantiation snapshot — RAN1" ;
    rdfs:comment "Subset of https://w3id.org/spectra# containing only the OWL classes / object properties / datatype properties that have >=1 instance in the RAN1 KG snapshot. Use OWL diff against the released spectra.ttl to verify schema-fit (no extensions required). Body text is NOT included." .

